## The eigenvalues and eigenvectors of a square matrix.
##
## **Signature:** `eig : Tensor<2, Scalar<ρ,d>> -> (Tensor<1, Complex[d]>, Tensor<2, Complex<1>>)`
##
## The eigenvectors are the columns of the returned matrix: the result is
