## Singular value decomposition `list(U, S, V)` of matrix `A`.
##
## **Signature:** `svd : Tensor<2, Scalar<ρ,d>> -> (Tensor<2, Scalar<ρ,1>>, Tensor<1, Scalar<ρ,d>>, Tensor<2, Scalar<ρ,1>>)`
##
